Third-party code

This repository is based on NORM (https://github.com/OSVAI/NORM), which is
itself based on RepDistiller (https://github.com/HobbitLong/RepDistiller).
The directories crd/, dataset/, distiller_zoo/, helper/, models/ and scripts/,
and the files train_cifar_teacher.py and train_cifar_student.py, contain code
from these projects, modified for AKD. Both projects are licensed under the
BSD 2-Clause License. Their license texts follow.

